  ['09-19', 'Sophie L.', 'Couple', 1, 'Travel forum', 'Hair in the shower, no apology', 'Found hair in the shower and a stain on the duvet cover. Reception moved us but nobody apologised. Breakfast was fine. Not what you expect at this price.',
